<title>PHILIPPINES: Semirara Coal raises par value to one peso.</title>
<headline>Semirara Coal raises par value to one peso.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semirara Coal Corp said on Monday its board had agreed to increase the par value of its shares to one peso each from the present one centavo.</p>
<p>The increase in par value would still have to be ratified by its shareholders in a meeting to be called soon, the company told the Philippine Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
